sequenceDiagram
    actor Staff
    participant UI as ServerIndex (Livewire)
    participant S as ServerService
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant Q as queue worker
    participant Y as ServerSyncer
    participant I as Infra (flaky, lies)

    Staff->>UI: New server
    UI->>S: create(customer, name)
    S->>DB: BEGIN
    S->>DB: INSERT server (pending, infra_token = uuid)
    S->>DB: allocate IP (SELECT .. SKIP LOCKED, INSERT open assignment)
    Note over DB: pool empty -> exception -> ROLLBACK, no server
    S->>DB: COMMIT
    S-->>Q: SyncServer(id) after commit
    loop until running (every 3 s, max N passes)
        Q->>Y: sync(server)
        Y->>I: GET /servers/token
        alt unknown (404)
            Y->>I: PUT /servers/token
            Note over I: 503: did nothing. 500: did it anyway.<br/>Same token, so asking again never makes a second server.
        else creating
            Note over Y: wait for the next pass
        else running
            Y->>DB: UPDATE status = running, started_at = clock WHERE status = pending
        end
    end
